pinp-by-faemiyah (1.0+git20170414-0ddebs9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/control : removed the libsdl1.2-compat dependency, the package
    does not exist anymore on resolute and forky (libsdl1.2debian is now
    sdl12-compat), which made the package uninstallable
  * debian/control : longer description
  * debian/copyright : upstream license is BSD-3-Clause (see COPYING)
  * debian/patches/01_fix_makefile.patch : don't install the ftoi
    development helper in /usr/bin
  * debian/patches/03,04 : added DEP-3 descriptions
  * debian/patches/05_vsync-and-x11-default.patch : enable V-Sync and
    default SDL_VIDEODRIVER to x11
  * Removed the launcher script, the .desktop file runs the intro directly
    (the launcher needed common-install-function-ddebs, which was not in
    Depends)
  * debian/rules : enabled all hardening flags
  * debian/resources/pinp-by-faemiyah.desktop : added Keywords and a French
    comment
  * debian/pinp-by-faemiyah.6.md : rewritten, regenerated the manual page
  * debian/pinp-by-faemiyah.lintian-overrides : override the groff warning of
    the pandoc generated manual page

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:22:36 +0100

